500 lists, lengths 0-5 (80 empty)
std: mk_xlist_term / dest_xlist (500 lists)        500 of 500
std: mk_xlist_term = xcons ... xnil                500 of 500
std: dest_xcons / is_xnil_term                     500 of 500
std: cons with tail c                              is_xlist false, dest_xlist refused
std: cons binding x                                is_xlist false, dest_xlist refused
std: xnil with a parameter                         is_xlist false, dest_xlist refused
std: xrewrite round trip                           true
std: xrewrite of an xcons                          is false, dest refused
std: xbind                                         is true; of xcons false
std: xstring_dep0 round trip                       true
std: xstring with no subterm                       is false, dest refused
std: xstring with a bound subterm                  is false, dest refused
std: variable z                                    is_fso true, dest_fso_var z
std: z<||> (no contexts, no arguments)             is_fso true, dest_fso_var z
std: z<|H|> (a context, no arguments)              is_fso true, dest_fso_var z
std: z[c] (an argument)                            is_fso false, dest_fso_var refused
std: the term c                                    is_fso false, dest_fso_var refused
std: construct_redex [|p;q;r|] [c;d] [x]           binders p,q,r, body is params @ terms true
std: xconcl_term                                   Perv!xconcl, 0 subterms
